                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. Winds northwesterly 25 to 35 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-05T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-06T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-04T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-05T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the morning and afternoon. Damaging winds possible. Winds northwesterly 30 to 45 km/h turning west to southwesterly 35 to 50 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to around 11 with daytime temperatures reaching between 14 and 17.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 10:00am to 2:40pm, UV Index predicted to reach 5 [Moderate]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-06T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-07T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-05T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-06T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Cloudy. Medium chance of showers, most likely in the late morning and afternoon. Winds southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h becoming light before dawn then becoming south to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h in the late evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 11 with daytime temperatures reaching around 15.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-07T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-08T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-06T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-07T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Winds southerly 15 to 20 km/h tending southeasterly during the morning then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 7 and 10 with daytime temperatures reaching around 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-09-08T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-09T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-07T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-08T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. Light winds becoming southerly 15 to 25 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 5 and 9 with daytime temperatures reaching around 16.</text>
            </forecast-period>
